 + mapping"},{"text":"GIS projects"}],[{"text":"Geospatial Technician"},{"text":"GIS + field data"},{"text":"Internship"}],[{"text":"Mapping Assistant"},{"text":"Cartography + GIS"},{"text":"Map portfolio"}],[{"text":"Remote Sensing Assistant"},{"text":"Satellite imagery"},{"text":"Remote-sensing project"}],[{"text":"Survey Data Processing Assistant"},{"text":"Survey data + CAD"},{"text":"Survey-to-CAD project"}],[{"text":"UAV Mapping Assistant"},{"text":"Drone + photogrammetry"},{"text":"UAV project"}],[{"text":"CAD/GIS Technician"},{"text":"CAD + GIS"},{"text":"CAD portfolio"}],[{"text":"Junior Geospatial Analyst"},{"text":"GIS + spatial analysis"},{"text":"Spatial analysis project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"With experience"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Surveying Assistant","Survey Technician","Senior Survey Technician","Survey Supervisor"]},{"type":"p","text":"or:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GIS Assistant","GIS Analyst","Senior GIS Analyst","GIS Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"or:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Remote Sensing Assistant","Remote Sensing Analyst","Senior Analyst","Geospatial Specialist"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"A Surveying Assistant is a field-oriented role."},{"type":"p","text":"Students should be prepared for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Outdoor work"},{"text":"Travel to project locations"},{"text":"Early field starts"},{"text":"Uneven terrain"},{"text":"Weather exposure"},{"text":"Equipment handling"},{"text":"Repetitive measurements"},{"text":"Strict accuracy requirements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A student who wants primarily office-based work may prefer:"},{"type":"h","text":"GIS Analyst / Remote Sensing Analyst / Geospatial Data Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"rather than traditional surveying."},{"type":"p","text":"Also note that certain higher-level surveying or legally responsible land-survey roles may have jurisdiction-specific statutory qualification/licensing req